{"supplier":"hotelbeds","supplierHotelId":"2839","name":"Villa Side Hotel","description":"This pleasant hotel is located in Kumköy, within 200 m of Side's most beautiful sandy beach. It is 60 km to the airport, while the centre of Side, where guests will discover a selection of shopping and entertainment venues, is about 5 km away. Links to the public transport network and an abundance of restaurants and bars are within a few paces of the hotel and it is about 250 m to the nearest nightclubs. Renovated in 2002, this hotel comprises a 5-storey main building and a 2-storey annexe block offering a total of 151 units. Leisure facilities include an indoor swimming pool and an outdoor pool with children's area, a poolside snack bar and a sun terrace with parasols and sun loungers laid out for guests. There is also a SPA area with a sauna and massage offerings as well as steam baths and Turkish baths. Sports options are available to more active guests.","address":"Kumköy Mevkii, S/N","city":"SIDE","countryCode":"TR","postalCode":"07600","lat":36.813495,"lng":31.3304,"stars":4,"chain":"VSHOT","giataCode":"4933","phone":"+902427561215","email":"info@villasidehotel.com","website":"www.villasidehotel.com","images":[{"url":"https://photos.hotelbeds.com/giata/bigger/00/002839/002839a_hb_a_006.jpg","category":"exterior","order":0},{"url":"https://photos.hotelbeds.com/giata/bigger/00/002839/002839_hb_a_004.jpg","category":"exterior","order":1},{"url":"https://photos.hotelbeds.com/giata/bigger/00/002839/002839a_hb_a_001.jpg","category":"exterior","order":2},{"url":"https://photos.hotelbeds.com/giata/bigger/00/002839/002839a_hb_a_008.jpg","category":"exterior","order":3},{"url":"https://photos.hotelbeds.com/giata/bigger/00/002839/002839a_hb_l_001.jpg","category":"lobby","order":4},{"url":"https://photos.hotelbeds.com/giata/bigger/00/002839/002839a_hb_w_005.jpg","category":"room","order":5},{"url":"https://photos.hotelbeds.com/giata/bigger/00/002839/002839a_hb_w_006.jpg","category":"